```Title: Many Failed Logons for One Account (raw Windows Security events)```
```ATT&CK: T1110.001 | Severity: medium | Sigma id: ea8a0a2b-0486-4175-b285-bd5df74e3f5f```
```Data source: Windows Security EventCode 4625 (Splunk Add-on for Microsoft Windows). Change index to where your Security logs live.```
```False positives: Users with a stale password on a phone or mapped drive; Misconfigured services or scheduled tasks```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity medium.```
index=wineventlog source IN ("XmlWinEventLog:Security", "WinEventLog:Security")
(EventCode=4625)
| bin _time span=10m
| stats count as event_count by _time TargetUserName
| search event_count >= 10
